  {
   "step": "原因 / 做法第 3 步",
   "fact": "proto 的 int32 以 varint 写出，负值先符号扩展成 64 位再编码，线上长 10 字节",
   "source": "android.util.proto.ProtoOutputStream#writeInt32；com.google.protobuf.CodedOutputStream#computeInt32SizeNoTag；com.google.protobuf.WireFormat#MAX_VARINT_SIZE",
   "kind": "安卓平台",
   "origin": "沿用并复核"
  },
  {
   "step": "做法第 3 步",
   "fact": "负的 int32 走 writeRawVarint64：每次取 val & 0x7F，不是最后一组时或上 0x80，再无符号右移 7 位，按 64 位做完",
   "source": "android.util.proto.ProtoOutputStream#writeUnsignedVarintFromSignedInt；android.util.proto.EncodedBuffer#writeRawVarint64",
   "kind": "安卓平台",
   "origin": "沿用并复核"
  },
  {
   "step": "做法第 3 步",
   "fact": "按这一算法，INT32_MIN 的值部分编码为 80 80 80 80 F8 FF FF FF FF 01",
   "source": "android.util.proto.EncodedBuffer#writeRawVarint64",
   "kind": "安卓平台",
   "origin": "沿用并复核"
  },
  {
   "step": "做法第 1 步",
   "fact": "wire type：VARINT 0、FIXED64 1、LENGTH_DELIMITED 2、FIXED32 5；tag 的低 3 位是 wire type",
   "source": "com.google.protobuf.WireFormat#WIRETYPE_VARINT；com.google.protobuf.WireFormat#TAG_TYPE_BITS",
   "kind": "安卓平台",
   "origin": "沿用并复核"
  },
  {
   "step": "做法第 1、2 步",
   "fact": "protobuf 读端 readInt32 返回 readRawVarint32（按 varint 读）；readFixed32、readSFixed32 都读 4 字节小端，readFloat 是对同样 4 字节做 Float.intBitsToFloat",
   "source": "com.google.protobuf.CodedInputStream#readInt32；com.google.protobuf.CodedInputStream#readSFixed32；com.google.protobuf.CodedInputStream#readFloat",
   "kind": "安卓平台",
   "origin": "沿用并复核"
  },
  {
   "step": "做法第 1、2 步",
   "fact": "Java 的 readFixed32 与 readSFixed32 都返回 int（同一读法），两者只差语义；fixed32 的值域是 0..2^32-1",
   "source": "com.google.protobuf.CodedInputStream#readFixed32；com.google.protobuf.CodedInputStream#readSFixed32",
